  "description": "AbpCluster.Sites: two sites for an ABP site on .NET 10 and PostgreSQL, one active and one standby that runs and takes over. The standby's servers start safely on a read-only replica and take over once its database is promoted; a replaced site stands down; operators promote with a break-glass key; a planned switchover loses nothing. PostgreSQL's own replication carries the data.",
